===persian===

برای مریم
تا تو با منی
گل برای من گل است.
شب برای من شب است
سبزه... سبزه است.
برف ها برای من
ژاله های خفته اند
آبهای مرده اند
ابرهای سال خورده اند.
کوه ها برای من دوانتهای دره اند.
تا تو با منی
آسمان برای من...
راه آبی پرنده است.
گریه خاک خیس دانه های خنده است.
تا تو با منی...
رنگ برف ها سپید و رنگ ابرها کبود.
تا تو با منی...
ابر رنگ ابر دارد و.... دود رنگ دود
بی تو زندگی چه سود.
بی تو... روزها و.... برف ها و.....
ابرها و.... شام ها....
نه سپیدشان سپید...
نه کبودشان کبود... نه سیاهشان سیاه....
بی تو آسمان پاک سینه ام..... کهکشان هر ستاره گناه
تو برای من... مثل جیوه ای برای آینه..... بی تو شیشه ام.....
بی تو عمق من... پر از تهیست....
بی تو در کویر بهت من سراب نیست....
بی تو زندگی برای من سراب... بی تو نقش من بر آب...
بی تو سرب سایه ها درون من مذاب....
سوز آه من... این کبوتر غمین گمشده...
روی بام حنجرم به خون نشسته است.... خون خاموشی...
در رگ ترانه های من لخته بسته است....
بی تو... شام ها و برف ها و ابرها.....
نه... سیاهشان سیاه... نه... سپیدشان سپید...
نه... کبودشان کبود
بی تو زندگی چه سود

۱۳۴۲

===machine===

For Maryam

As long as you are with me
Flowers are flowers for me.
Night is night for me
Greenery... is greenery.
Snows are for me
Sleeping dewdrops
Dead waters
Clouds are old.
Mountains are the ends of valleys for me.
As long as you are with me
The sky is for me...
The blue path of birds.
The cry of wet soil is the seeds of laughter.
As long as you are with me...
The color of snow is white and the color of clouds is blue.
As long as you are with me...
Clouds are the color of clouds and....smoke is the color of smoke
What good is life without you?
Without you...days and....snows and.....
Clouds and....evenings...
Neither their white is white...
Neither their blue is blue... nor their black is black...
Without you, the sky is pure in my chest..... The galaxy of every star is sin
You are to me... like mercury for a mirror..... Without you, I am glass.....
Without you, my depth... is full of emptiness....
Without you, in the desert, there is no mirage for me....
Without you, life is a mirage for me... Without you, my footprint on the water...
Without you, the lead of the shadows inside me is molten....
My burning ah... This dove of sorrow is lost...
The roof of my throat is filled with blood.... The blood of silence...
A clot has formed in the veins of my songs....
Without you... The evenings and the snows and the clouds.....
No... their black is black... No... their white is white...
No... their blue is blue
Without you, what is the use of life

1342

===lantern===

For Maryam

As long as you are with me
a flower, to me, is a flower.
Night, to me, is night.
Green grass... is green grass.
The snows, to me,
are sleeping dew,
are dead waters,
are aged clouds.
Mountains, to me, are the two ends of the valley.
As long as you are with me
the sky, to me, is...
the blue road of the bird.
The weeping of the wet earth is the seed of laughter.
As long as you are with me...
the color of snow is white, the color of clouds is blue.
As long as you are with me...
cloud wears the color of cloud, and... smoke the color of smoke.
Without you, what good is life?
Without you... the days, and... the snows, and...
the clouds, and... the evenings...
their white is not white,
their blue not blue, their black not black.
Without you the sky of my chest is bare... a galaxy where every star is a sin.
You are to me like the quicksilver to a mirror... without you I am only glass.
Without you my depths are brimming with emptiness...
without you, in the desert of my stupor, there is not even a mirage...
without you life is a mirage to me... without you my image is drawn on water...
without you the lead of the shadows runs molten inside me...
The burning of my sigh, this lost and grieving dove,
has settled in blood on the roof of my throat... the blood of silence
has clotted in the veins of my songs...
Without you... the evenings, the snows, the clouds...
no — their black not black... no — their white not white...
no — their blue not blue.
Without you, what good is life?

1342

